' 4+1 Scenarios (+1) - Guess the daily Pokémon (US06)
' Version 1.0 - 2026-10-21
' Shows how the Logical view (GuessViewModel, GuessGame, PokemonRepository, GuessGameRepository) supports the
' daily game: the first visit of the day picks a species and saves the round in Room, so the pick and the
' progress survive closing the app; every guess is checked by GuessGame, a plain Kotlin class.
' The answer is a species name; the artwork and the detail page use the species' default Pokémon.
' System test: GuessPokemonSystemTest.
@startuml scenarios-guess-pokemon
!include ../style.puml

title Scenario - guess the daily Pokémon
autonumber

actor User
participant GuessScreen
participant GuessViewModel
participant GuessGame
participant PokemonRepository
participant GuessGameRepository
database "Local Database" as LocalDb
participant PokeAPI <<external>>

User -> GuessScreen : opens the Guess tab
GuessScreen -> GuessViewModel : observes uiState
GuessViewModel -> PokemonRepository : getAllSpecies()
PokemonRepository -> PokeAPI : GET pokemon-species?limit=100000
GuessViewModel -> GuessGameRepository : getRound(today)
GuessGameRepository -> LocalDb : SELECT daily_round
alt no round saved today
    GuessViewModel -> GuessGame : newRound(today, species)
    GuessViewModel -> GuessGameRepository : saveRound(round)
end
GuessViewModel -> PokemonRepository : getDefaultPokemon(species)
PokemonRepository -> PokeAPI : GET pokemon-species/{name}, pokemon/{default}
GuessViewModel --> GuessScreen : Playing (silhouette, 3 hearts, streak)
User -> GuessScreen : types a name, taps Guess
GuessScreen -> GuessViewModel : guess(input)
GuessViewModel -> GuessGame : guess(round, input, species names)
alt correct
    GuessViewModel -> GuessGame : afterRound(streak, Won)
    GuessViewModel -> GuessGameRepository : saveRound, saveStreak
    GuessViewModel --> GuessScreen : Finished (artwork, name, streak + 1)
else wrong (third miss ends the round)
    GuessViewModel -> GuessGameRepository : saveRound(one heart less)
    GuessViewModel --> GuessScreen : Playing, or Finished with streak 0
else not a Pokémon, or already guessed
    GuessViewModel --> GuessScreen : message, no heart lost
end
User -> GuessScreen : taps Open details
GuessScreen -> User : detail page of the default Pokémon
@enduml
